DATA CLEANING. 
Duplicate Rows - Duplicate rows are rows that have been registered more than one time.
Trim and Clean - removes the space character OR other specified characters from the start or end of a string.
Text casing - Changes the casing of each text using functions such as; PROPER, LOWERCASE, UPPERCASE.
Missing values - These are values called the 'Null values'. 
Split Names- The use of Delimiters to separate text. 

